INFECTED.SIG

MALWARE ANALYSIS WARNING

This repository contains malware samples, malware-related tools, and/or references to them. Any item may be malicious, modified, backdoored, or otherwise unsafe. Treat all files as untrusted.

Use these materials only for lawful, authorized malware analysis, detection, and reverse engineering. Do not use them to infect systems, steal information, evade security controls, or otherwise harm people or organizations.

Use is entirely at your own risk. The repository maintainers and contributors provide the materials “as is” and accept no responsibility for damage, data loss, compromise, or legal consequences resulting from their use.

Do not run samples on a personal, production, or network-connected system. If analysis is necessary, use a properly isolated, disposable virtual lab with networking disabled or tightly controlled, and take precautions to prevent sample escape or exposure of sensitive data. A virtual machine alone does not guarantee safety.

Do not upload samples to public analysis services unless you are authorized to disclose them and have considered the risk of exposing confidential or personal data. Follow applicable laws, organizational policies, and responsible-disclosure procedures.

By accessing or using these materials, you acknowledge these risks and accept responsibility for your actions.
